 alt=\"极限解放 光辉认证的坚定信仰.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/r0lcwyzhxcgn1h4hlm470uhol6oa5of.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%85%89%E8%BE%89%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E5%9D%9A%E5%AE%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/r0lcwyzhxcgn1h4hlm470uhol6oa5of.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%85%89%E8%BE%89%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%9A%84%E5%9D%9A%E5%AE%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/91/r0lcwyzhxcgn1h4hlm470uhol6oa5of.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />光辉认证的坚定信仰\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">6%</font>。获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加同等点数，每回合最多增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">6</font>点。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，自身魔攻的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>附加在物攻上。<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，自身魔攻额外的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>附加在物攻上，且暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">8%</font>。获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加同等点数，每回合最多增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">6</font>点。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，自身魔攻的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>附加在物攻上，暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，且每点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]使暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>。<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，自身魔攻额外的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>附加在物攻上，且暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加同等点数，每回合最多增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">6</font>点。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]有以下效果：<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点时，自身魔攻的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>附加在物攻上，暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，且每点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]使暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>。<br />大于等于<font color=\"#58cb48\">50</font>点时，自身魔攻额外的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">30%</font>附加在物攻上，且暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"苏醒之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/40px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/60px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/80px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：120<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"ht